meta {
  name: orders
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  Run auth (adminToken, waiterToken, kitchenToken) first.
  The tickets go to table 50 and stay open: every run adds 2 tickets (the round keeps growing) until the table is closed or npm run seed clears the orders.
  "Mark dish sold out" changes a real dish: the last request puts it back on the menu.
}
